      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Gás. Gastly envolve o adversário com seu corpo gasoso e o enfraquece aos poucos, envenenando-o através da pele. Embora não possua uma forma sólida, ele consegue cercar oponentes de qualquer tamanho e fazê- los sufocar.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Amorfo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Gastly pode evoluir para Haunter no nível 9 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Hypnosis, Lick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Spite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Mean Look</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Curse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Night Shade</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Confuse Ray</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Sucker Punch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Payback</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Shadow Ball</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Dream Eater</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Dark Pulse</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Destiny Bond</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Hex, Nightmare</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acid Spray, Ally Switch, Attract, Confide, Confuse Ray, Corrosive Gas, Curse, Dark Pulse, Dazzling Gleam, Double Team, Dream Eater, Embargo, Endure, Energy Ball, Explosion, Facade, Fire Punch, Foul Play, Frustration, Giga Drain, Gunk Shot, Haze, Hex, Hidden Power, Ice Punch, Icy Wind, Imprison, Infestation, Knock Off, Nasty Plot, Night Shade, Ominous Wind, Pain Split, Payback, Poison Jab, Poltergeist, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Round, Scary Face, Self- Destruct, Shadow Ball, Skill Swap, Skitter Smack, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Sludge Wave, Snatch, Snore, Spite, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Taunt, Telekinesis, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder, Thunder Punch, Thunderbolt, Torment, Toxic, Trick, Trick Room, Uproar, Venoshock, Will- O-Wisp, Wonder Room</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Astonish, Clear Smog, Disable, Fire Punch, Grudge, Haze, Ice Punch, Perish Song, Psywave, Reflect Type, Scary Face, Smog, Thunder Punch, Toxic</p>",
